    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d213">

                <pb facs="0285" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg203"/>

                <head>Mr. Campbell to Mr.
                        Hunter</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 22.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Stockholm,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 12, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose a copy of the
                    reply of Count Manderstrom, his Swedish Majesty’s minister of state and of
                    foreign affairs, to my note of the 8th instant, (see despatch No. 20,) conveying
                    to him three proclamations issued by the President of the United States.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES H. CAMPBELL.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Hunter,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of State, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                            &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d213-a1.xml" xpointer="d213-a1"/>
            </div>
